### Task 26：真实 Java → Python → Java/MySQL 公共 API 冒烟
### 仅覆盖会话、学习设置治理和事件重放，不代表 DeepSeek/容器/浏览器已验收。
### 先启动 Java(local profile)、FastAPI。注册独立账户，不使用个人正式账户。
### 在 HTTP Client 私有环境中设置 demoPassword（强密码）。不要提交环境文件。
### 自动断言更完整的等价版本：ai-service/.venv/bin/python scripts/agent-native-smoke.py

@javaHost = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. Java 健康检查
GET {{javaHost}}/actuator/health

> {%
  client.test("Java UP", () => client.assert(response.status === 200 && response.body.status === "UP"));
%}

### 2. 注册独立验收账户
POST {{javaHost}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "agent-native-e2e-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}",
  "displayName": "Task26 独立验收"
}

> {%
  client.test("注册成功", () => client.assert(response.status === 201));
  client.global.set("accessToken", response.body.accessToken);
  client.global.set("pendingActionId", "");
%}

### 3. 初始化该演示用户设置（新用户查询设置可能返回 404）
PUT {{javaHost}}/api/user-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai",
  "dailyStudyLimitMinutes": 60,
  "weekendPreference": "SAME",
  "defaultPrivacyLevel": "NORMAL",
  "weeklyAvailability": []
}

### 4. 创建会话，伪造 ownerId 不应生效；公共响应不暴露 ownerId
POST {{javaHost}}/api/assistant/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"ownerId": "attacker"}

> {%
  client.test("READY 且身份字段已移除", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 201);
    client.assert(response.body.status === "READY");
    client.assert(response.body.ownerId === undefined);
  });
  client.global.set("conversationId", response.body.conversationId);
%}

### 5. 确定性的 HIGH 风险动作，不用含糊的“规划今日任务”触发确认
POST {{javaHost}}/api/assistant/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "把每天学习时间调整为 30 分钟", "idempotencyKey": "task26-settings-preview"}

> {%
  client.test("真实待确认契约", () => {
    client.assert(response.status === 200);
    client.assert(response.body.status === "WAITING_CONFIRMATION");
    client.assert(response.body.pendingAction.toolName === "settings.learning.update");
    client.assert(response.body.pendingAction.riskLevel === "HIGH");
  });
  client.global.set("pendingActionId", response.body.pendingAction.actionId);
%}

### 6. 普通聊天中的“确认”不能写入
POST {{javaHost}}/api/assistant/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"message": "确认", "idempotencyKey": "task26-chat-confirm"}

> {%
  client.test("仍需专用确认", () => client.assert(response.body.status === "WAITING_CONFIRMATION"));
%}

### 7. 确认前必须仍为 60
GET {{javaHost}}/api/user-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
  client.test("未提前修改", () => client.assert(response.body.dailyStudyLimitMinutes === 60));
%}

### 8. 专用确认
POST {{javaHost}}/api/assistant/conversations/{{conversationId}}/actions/{{pendingActionId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
  client.test("执行完成", () => client.assert(response.status === 200 && response.body.status === "COMPLETED"));
%}

### 9. 查业务数据，不只看 COMPLETED 字样
GET {{javaHost}}/api/user-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
  client.test("真实写入 30 分钟", () => client.assert(response.body.dailyStudyLimitMinutes === 30));
%}

### 10. 保存执行与审计快照
GET {{javaHost}}/api/agent-executions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {% client.global.set("executionsBeforeRepeat", JSON.stringify(response.body)); %}

###
GET {{javaHost}}/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {% client.global.set("auditBeforeRepeat", JSON.stringify(response.body)); %}

### 11. 重复确认
POST {{javaHost}}/api/assistant/conversations/{{conversationId}}/actions/{{pendingActionId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 12. 确认没有新增执行或审计
GET {{javaHost}}/api/agent-executions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
  client.test("执行幂等", () => client.assert(JSON.stringify(response.body) === client.global.get("executionsBeforeRepeat")));
%}

###
GET {{javaHost}}/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

> {%
  client.test("审计幂等", () => client.assert(JSON.stringify(response.body) === client.global.get("auditBeforeRepeat")));
%}

### 13. 有限事件重放（当前不是长连接 token 实时推送）
GET {{javaHost}}/api/assistant/conversations/{{conversationId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Last-Event-ID: 0

### 14. 游标后只返回 sequence > 1；精确集合与顺序由 smoke.py 自动比较
GET {{javaHost}}/api/assistant/conversations/{{conversationId}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Last-Event-ID: 1

### Runner 实际执行、Rubric、Git、浏览器验收另按 task26 结果文档的未验收清单逐项完成。
### 此脚本不登记用户真实源码目录，不执行 commit/push，也不把预览写成容器执行成功。
